_5`, or `current` versus `previous`, survive the demonstrations and change the dense query.\n\n**Proposed fix.** Extend the lesson assembly/export tool (the layer that already invokes semantic rivals and query rotations) with a bounded `PARAMETER_SETTINGS`/declared-rival contract. Evaluate the exact selected program and alternatives once per unique input, fail required exports when an alternative fits all demos but changes a query, and emit the witness indices and hashes. Keep a diagnostic policy for intentionally staged curricula to avoid false positives."},{"id":"F2","text":"Offer one shared strict entry-point validator for generator scalars\n\n**Symptom.** The selected approved generator duplicated permissive Python behavior: booleans, floats, strings, and negative indices reached RNG/profile logic. The defect lint found 33 warnings, but each task currently needs custom validation to repair the same public contract.\n\n**Concrete evidence.** `checks/before/checks/964b23808a3c_before_defect_lint.log` and G1 in `REVIEW.md`.\n\n**Proposed fix.** Add a small public helper alongside `gen_ctx` for exact nonnegative integer seed/sample-index validation, and have generator templates call it before any coercion. Keep defect lint as an independent adversarial check. This is a shared convenience, not a request to weaken task-local tests."}],"packet_id":"78f0415abaad620af8aed8e83e5a0404e7f1b427e46f3acb367636e0fdfd2881","reviewer_blind_solve":{"attempt_count":2,"attempt_intents":{"solve-blind/attempts/0001/report.json":"diagnostic_probe","solve-blind/attempts/0002/report.json":"solve"},"attempt_reports":["solve-blind/attempts/0001/report.json","solve-blind/attempts/0002/report.json"],"earlier_rule_exposure":"no","feedback_policy":"visible_only","generator_hash":"e9e4cab81b481534073f9f04311f84c83e1ccae8cef1e7080a5ba4caa16fcc26","instance_hash":"b0134c04cf1ed862aca315fb361a4c17bbe0bd2479b9ac3a2a784dc8b961fd1d","reference_consulted_during_solve":false,"solve_kind":"blind_before_